### All events
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events

### Search
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events?q=game

### One event
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events/2

### Event that does not exist
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events/999

### Create an event
POST http://localhost:3000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Pierogi workshop",
  "date": "2026-12-03T17:00",
  "location": "Student kitchen",
  "capacity": 15
}

### Invalid event
POST http://localhost:3000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "x", "date": "tomorrow", "capacity": -5 }

### Update event 4
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/events/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Pierogi workshop",
  "date": "2026-12-03T17:00",
  "location": "Student kitchen",
  "capacity": 20
}

### Delete event 4
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/events/4

### Stats
GET http://localhost:3000/api/stats

### Title too long 
POST http://localhost:3000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "fnfunrundsninifnjfnsnjinfinsiirnunrsmicnruifnizskmcurbfunamenbbcanmknbbsnibucunimcnvubcnimcsnbucdxmmcnubcdnxsmkscvniucixmkmconvffimksmacdnvubnijmokmcovfncimkcsdvimkosdcfnscjmk",
  "date": "2027-01-10T18:00",
  "location": "Main hall",
  "capacity": 10
}

### Date in the past
POST http://localhost:3000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Past event",
  "date": "2020-01-01T10:00",
  "location": "Main hall",
  "capacity": 10
}

### Location too long 
POST http://localhost:3000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Long location",
  "date": "2027-01-10T18:00",
  "location": "rfnjwimerewnjimkicvjnufbcnijminevbunjimwqwenvrnuxmowqdfbyrefwnqiowqdbfhujmxr4tbvcwunimowebcyahunsjivrrbchnudmikavgbyhunjimewracwxVBYUNVIFCASDVBUHNJIECADSXGBYHUNbhunjevicsdybnhvrjicedsbnvjemcdsbhnujivecds",
  "capacity": 10
}

### Description too long 
POST http://localhost:3000/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Long description",
  "date": "2027-01-10T18:00",
  "description": "",
  "capacity": 10
}

### From date
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events?from=2026-11-01

### Sort by title
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events?sort=title

### Search + sort
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events?q=night&sort=title

### All three together
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events?q=a&from=2026-10-20&sort=title

### Invalid from
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events?from=banana